      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "\n## Chatterbox Turbo TTS (fast, expressive)\n\nGPT2-based, faster than the standard model, and supports inline\nparalinguistic tags for emotion:\n\n`[laugh]` `[sigh]` `[gasp]` `[chuckle]` `[cough]` `[sniff]`\n`[groan]` `[clear throat]`\n\nExample: `You'll never catch me now. [laugh]`\n\n**Optional voice cloning:** unmute `Load Audio`, upload a 5-10 s clean\nvoice clip, connect it to `audio_prompt`.\n\nDriven by `generate_speech.py --model chatterbox-turbo` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "\n## Chatterbox Turbo TTS (fast, expressive)\n\nGPT2-based, faster than the standard model, and supports inline\nparalinguistic tags for emotion:\n\n`[laugh]` `[sigh]` `[gasp]` `[chuckle]` `[cough]` `[sniff]`\n`[groan]` `[clear throat]`\n\nExample: `You'll never catch me now. [laugh]`\n\n**Optional voice cloning:** unmute `Load Audio`, upload a 5-10 s clean\nvoice clip, connect it to `audio_prompt`.\n\nDriven by `generate_speech.py --model chatterbox-turbo` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
